{"displayStem":"68세 남자가 오른쪽 발가락 궤양이 6주간 낫지 않아 왔다. 당뇨병과 만성콩팥병이 있고 발 감각이 둔하다. 안정 후 양측 관류검사를 시행했다. 그림의 가는 오른발, 나는 왼발이다. TBI는 발가락 수축기압을 높은 쪽 상완 수축기압으로 나눈 값이다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"증례·관찰값은 교육용 합성 자료이다."},{"kind":"provenance","text":"양쪽 발의 ABI와 TBI (교육용 합성 측정값)","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C03 c03-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"measurement-panels\"><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>양쪽 발의 ABI와 TBI</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"양쪽 발의 ABI와 TBI (교육용 합성 측정값)。ABI (무차원)、TBI (무차원)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">TBI (무차원)</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"76\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"186\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"186\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"186\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0.5</text><line x1=\"296\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"296\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"406\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1.5</text><line x1=\"516\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"516\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"516\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"185.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"185.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"190.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.3</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.6</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"98.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"98.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.9</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"end\">1.2</text><circle cx=\"445.59999999999997\" cy=\"200\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"301\" r=\"3\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"97\" y=\"306\">가</text><rect x=\"336.8\" y=\"115.59999999999998\" width=\"6.4\" height=\"6.4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"327\" y=\"298\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><text x=\"342\" y=\"306\">나</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ABI (무차원)</text></svg></figure></div></div></div>","<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C03 c03-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><table><thead><tr><th>항목</th><th>결과</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>높은 쪽 상완 수축기압 (mmHg)</td><td>140</td></tr><tr><td>오른발 발가락 맥파</td><td>진폭이 현저히 낮음</td></tr><tr><td>왼발 발가락 맥파</td><td>진폭 보존</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>"]}